  "briefTitle": "Neladalkib (NVL-655) for TKI-naive Patients With Advanced ALK-Positive NSCLC",
  "officialTitle": "A Phase 3 Study of the Selective Anaplastic Lymphoma Kinase (ALK) Inhibitor NVL-655 Compared to Alectinib in First-Line Treatment of Patients With ALK-Positive Advanced Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer (ALKAZAR)",
