      "text": "Histologically or cytologically confirmed locally advanced (not amenable for multimodality treatment) or metastatic Non-small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)",
      "plain": "Locally advanced (not for multimodality treatment) or metastatic NSCLC",
      "logic": {
